@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Mağaza
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?featured=true&tab=best

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/kemerli-kruvaze-trenckot

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "variantId": 3, "quantity": 1 } ], "couponCode": "DILEK10" }

### Admin girişi (yanıttaki dg_admin çerezi sonraki isteklerde kullanılır)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "dilek", "password": "Gelistirme2026", "remember": false }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stock?filter=critical

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/prices/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "increase": true, "percent": 10, "roundTo90": true, "apply": false }

### Sipariş (kartla ödeme: yanıtta paymentPageUrl döner)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test Müşteri", "email": "test@example.com", "phone": "05321234567",
  "address": "Test adres", "city": "İstanbul", "paymentMethod": "Kredi kartı", "installments": 1,
  "items": [ { "variantId": 3, "quantity": 1 } ], "couponCode": null, "note": null
}
